+
+    From frame 1, every `step` frames, add one keyframe by sampling two quaternion components
+    of the head bone rotation:
+      - rotation_quaternion[1] (x): sample region from [(0.2, 0.3), (-0.05, 0.05), (-0.3, -0.2)]
+      - rotation_quaternion[2] (y): sample region from [(0.4, 0.6), (-0.1, 0.1), (-0.6, -0.4)]
